<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>EchoVault — Your memories, beyond time</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css"></head><body><nav class="nav"><a class="brand" href="index.jsp"><span class="brand-mark">◈</span>echo<b>vault</b></a><div class="navlinks"><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="login.jsp">Sign in</a><a class="btn small" href="register.jsp">Create a capsule ↗</a></div></nav><main class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i> A message beyond the present</span><h1>Your memories.<br><span>Beyond time.</span></h1><p>Some moments are too meaningful for now. Seal your letters, photographs and voices inside a digital time capsule—and let the future open them.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="register.jsp">Create your first capsule <b>↗</b></a><a class="btn ghost" href="#experience">Explore the universe</a></div><p style="font-size:11px;margin-top:25px">✦ Private by design &nbsp; · &nbsp; Date-locked memories &nbsp; · &nbsp; Made for the moments that matter</p></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="portal"><div class="portal-inner"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="orbit two"></div><div class="capsule-core"></div></div></div><div class="float-card fc1">✧ FUTURE MESSAGE<small>To the person I'll become</small></div><div class="float-card fc2">◷ TIME LOCKED<small>Unlocking in the future</small></div></div></section><section class="section" id="experience"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">More than storage</span><h2>Memories deserve a moment.</h2><p>Turn today's feelings into tomorrow's discoveries with an experience designed around time, emotion and connection.</p></div><div class="grid3"><article class="glass feature"><div class="feature-icon">✉</div><h3>Letters to tomorrow</h3><p>Write to your future self, a loved one or someone you want to surprise.</p></article><article class="glass feature"><div class="feature-icon">◷</div><h3>Time-locked moments</h3><p>Choose the exact date when your capsule can be opened. The server enforces the lock.</p></article><article class="glass feature"><div class="feature-icon">✧</div><h3>Shared memory vault</h3><p>Invite a recipient by email and build a capsule around a shared story.</p></article></div></section><section class="section" id="how"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">A little magic, three steps</span><h2>Seal it. Let time pass. Rediscover.</h2></div><div class="grid3"><article class="glass feature"><span class="tag">01 · CREATE</span><h3>Capture the moment</h3><p>Add a title, a heartfelt note and an optional photo or document.</p></article><article class="glass feature"><span class="tag">02 · SEAL</span><h3>Choose the future</h3><p>Set an unlock date and keep the capsule private or address it to a recipient.</p></article><article class="glass feature"><span class="tag">03 · REVEAL</span><h3>Meet your memory</h3><p>Return when the countdown ends and open the memory you left behind.</p></article></div></section></main><footer class="footer">ECHO VAULT · YOUR MEMORIES, BEYOND TIME · A student project built with Java & MySQL</footer></body></html>